{
  "slug": "dev-forge",
  "name": "Dev Forge",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "SQLite-backed multi-agent development team orchestration with sprint contracts, wiki knowledge management, and automatic bug council escalation.\n\ndev-forge assembles an AI-powered development team — orchestrator, team leads, implementers, evaluators, and reviewers — coordinated via sprint contracts and a strict chain of command. All inter-agent communication goes through a single SQLite database, eliminating file-based message queues. Supports dynamic team composition, model escalation, knowledge wiki, and iteration learnings capture.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 commands** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Commands** (4): `gate` (Define machine-verifiable completion criteria and run pass/fail verification), `guide` (Manage the project knowledge base — add, list, search, and inject guidelines, decisions, and concepts), `init` (Initialize the dev-forge development setup for the current project), `team` (Place agent team definition files for a selected preset into .claude/agents/)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install dev-forge@claude-community` from `yn01/claude-plugins` (`plugins/dev-forge`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 2,
    "command": 4
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
